":"Rewritten to the concise citizen-facing editorial standard.","created_at":"2026-08-30T16:34:27.105799Z","maturity":"post_opinion","revision_number":1}],"schema_version":"1.0","sections":[{"heading":"What this case is about","paragraphs":["Lorie Smith runs a website design business. She claims Colorado law forces her to create messages that violate her conscience. The state argues the law targets discrimination, not speech. The Court must decide if the law targets expression."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 110, lines 45-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 110, lines 45-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 132, lines 43-45","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 132, lines 43-45"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 151, lines 37-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 151, lines 37-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 59, lines 25-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 59, lines 25-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 33-39","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 33-39"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on December 5, 2022."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 133, lines 43-1","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 133, lines 43-1"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 11-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 11-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 69, lines 39-43","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 69, lines 39-43"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["Smith wants the Court to strike down the state law as applied to her.","The state wants the Court to uphold the law as a valid anti-discrimination measure."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 110, lines 45-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 110, lines 45-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 132, lines 43-45","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 132, lines 43-45"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 151, lines 37-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/21-476_k43e.pdf","page_label":"file page 151, lines 37-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcri